  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at 21.7.10 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* 🔧 chore: check spelling with typos in pre-commit by @even-even in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3235\n* 🐛 fix(activation): keep and restore the user's TCL_LIBRARY and TK_LIBRARY by @darrenhuai in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3234\n* 🐛 fix(create): skip blank and comment lines in pyvenv.cfg by @r3wretrhy in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3232\n* 🐛 fix(activation): restore PKG_CONFIG_PATH that was not set before by @darrenhuai in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3233\n\n## New Contributors\n* @r3wretrhy made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3232\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.7.9...21.7.10",
